pvp.idle-together={modules} have been on for {seconds} s, with an enemy in front and {material} to spare, and the stack has not gone down. I cannot tell you which of the {count} is failing, and this measurement cannot: the inventory says how much {material} is left, not who placed it, so all this states is that none of them has placed any. I am not turning any off. Suspects — {suspects}.
